{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1149490/extras/51b9eb6828feb0be7d5b053fd421f72f.avif?t=1769489359\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bokube is a blend of 3D precision platforming, light-combat, movement, and puzzle elements all blended together into a grid based 3D action puzzle platformer adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A scary unknown evil has stolen your fellow kin! Each level has 3 yellow puzzle cube objectives to solve so you can save a fellow Bunny-Cube. As you progress through the adventure the game will throw tons of new kinds of puzzle cubes, enemies and trap hazards at you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-45 fun levels! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-9 bosses to defeat! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A cool soundtrack from various Japanese music artists, with a new song in every level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Polished 3D audio design to make every level feel atmospheric and satisfy your ears. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-6 zones of the game with 7 levels each that play, look, and feel unique from each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Increasingly challenging difficulty without holding your hand once you're out of the tutorial.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Beautiful full 3D graphics, with detailed textures, lots of particle effects, and a special &quot;Bevel Cube&quot; art style.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Secrets that will keep you up at night!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1149490?t=1769489359","background_raw":"https://s